<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain's Q2 M3 rises 1.0 percent quarter/quarter.</title>
<headline>Bahrain's Q2 M3 rises 1.0 percent quarter/quarter.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain's broadly defined M3 money supply rose 1.0 percent in the second quarter of 1996 compared with three months earlier, Bahrain Monetary Agency figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (percentage changes over three months)</p>
<p>	    June 1996    March 1996	  Dec 1995</p>
<p> M3	    +1.0	   -2.8		 +7.2</p>
<p> M2	    +1.1	   -0.2		 +1.8</p>
<p>Monetary aggregates (million dinars)</p>
<p>	    June 1996    March 1996	  Dec 1995</p>
<p> M3	   1,826.3	1,808.0	   1,859.7</p>
<p> M2	   1,411.2	1,395.3	   1,397.5</p>
</text>
